  "plain": "In 2023 the Department of Energy answered a request for footage known as Kettle 2 by saying it was \"unable to locate the footage\". Michels tells this himself, citing a mandatory declassification review request (a way to ask an agency to review secret records for release) filed on October 21, 2023 by a man named Jeff Cruickshank. He ties it to the same months as the first public claims of hidden UFO programmes, and to whether the government is holding back recordings."
